fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"nvdswrapper/index.html#nvdsdewarp:rotation-axes","fragment":"\n\trotation-axes\n\nRotation Axes to apply. X rotation rotates the view upward, Y rightward, and Z clockwise. Default is \"YXZ\" as known as yaw, pitch, roll\n\n\tFlags :\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\tRead\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t/\t\t\n\t\t\t\tWrite\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\tDefault value :\tyxz (2)\n\n"});